    <briefdescription>
<para>Allocate, free, and copy device memory. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Every memory API returns a <ref refid="namespacesunrise_1a6fa502bda47a00fb7a4aa76da2d7fd83" kindref="member">Status</ref> and the caller must check it. A device pointer is an opaque handle that may only be created / released by this group. </para>
